sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Client A
    participant S as Server
    participant B as Client B

    Note over S: bind, listen on localhost:8082

    A->>S: TCP connect
    Note over S: client_id = os.urandom(16)<br/>salt = today's date<br/>KDF = bcrypt.kdf(client_id, salt, 32 bytes)
    S->>A: client_id (16 bytes, plaintext)
    Note over A: salt = today's date<br/>KDF = bcrypt.kdf(client_id, salt, 32 bytes)

    Note over B,S: Client B connects the same way<br/>and gets its own client_id and KDF

    A->>A: Fernet(KDF_A).encrypt(message)
    A->>S: ciphertext
    Note over S: Fernet(KDF_A).decrypt(ciphertext)<br/>msg = id_A + " says: " + plaintext

    loop every connected client except the sender
        Note over S: Fernet(KDF_B).encrypt(msg)
        S->>B: ciphertext
    end

    Note over B: Fernet(KDF_B).decrypt(ciphertext)<br/>print(msg)
